    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6427c794994fd175bd67f2bf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6427c794994fd175bd67f2bf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Apr 2023 05:56:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近大家都非常关心旅居美国的国宝丫丫，无论是从丫丫自身的身体情况还是生活环境。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期让我们一起来聊聊作为普通民众的我们，可以为丫丫做些什么吧</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>调酒师：藜藜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>服务生：慕慕</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>驻讲师：藜藜，蓬蓬</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>今日特调：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苏格兰威士忌 45ml</span></p><span></span><p><span>杏仁利口酒 15ml</span></p><span></span><p><span>橘皮一片</span></p><span></span><p><span>冰球一个</span></p><span></span><p><span>将一个冰球加入古典威士忌杯，加入45ml苏格兰威士忌接着加入15ml杏仁利口酒，橘皮做装饰</span></p><span></span><p><span>以经典简洁的方式调配出优雅的味道，柑橘的酸甜中和标志性的烟熏气息，晶莹剔透的冰球象征至高的纯洁，反射时间万物，是神灵落入凡间的旅途。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsJ5N75uaom_N9oWyV4qx8qgtRNM.m4a" length="66207432" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrTDBBdFFpRTdYX2o5OVJmUXBQWUlndTBSN1YucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
