  <item>
    <title>E05-那些年我们逝去又不同的青春</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/636e7343165a4944db49796a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">636e7343165a4944db49796a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Nov 2022 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>六月七号对你来说意味着什么？是通向未来的唯一一辆列车还是路程中的一个转换站？志愿表的背后是数不清的家庭研讨会还是自己的深思熟虑？今天，让我们来一起聊聊高考那些事</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>服务生/调酒师：慕慕</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>调酒师：菲菲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>驻讲人：蓝蓝</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>嘉宾客人：哑哑、阿檀</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>「今日特调」</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>金酒 15ml</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>朗姆酒 15ml</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>伏特加 15ml</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>龙舌兰 15ml</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>君度橙酒 15ml</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>柠檬汁 5ml</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>原味糖浆 5ml</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>红茶饮品 5ml</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><em><span>将金酒15毫升，朗姆酒15毫升，伏特加15毫升，龙舌兰酒15毫升，橙酒15毫升倒入调酒器中摇匀。随后将5ml柠檬汁和糖浆倒入调酒器。摇匀后倒入酒杯中与红茶饮品搅拌均匀</span></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>开场音乐：</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>NOS BALLADES</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>背景音乐：</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Garota de Ipanema-Rose passos</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Weekend à Rome-Nouvelle Vague/Vanessa Paradis</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>结尾音乐：</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>光阴的故事-罗大佑</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
