  <item>
    <title>E04-群体“不是你想进，想进就能进”！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/635b8632aadc398d766190a8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">635b8632aadc398d766190a8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Oct 2022 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你是否畅享过与世隔绝的生活？但事实是，个体是无法独立于群体而存在的。我们期待志同道合的朋友，享受群体带来的温暖和支持，却也不得不面对它们造成的烦恼。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>服务生/调音师：暮暮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>调酒师：菲菲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>驻讲人：藜藜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>特邀客人：虫博士</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>后厨：蓝蓝</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>「特调配方」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1个马天尼杯</span></p><span></span><p><span>1 shot 意式双倍浓缩咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span>25ml伏特加</span></p><span></span><p><span>60ml咖啡味百利甜</span></p><span></span><p><span>15ml甜牛奶</span></p><span></span><p><span>1片柠檬</span></p><span></span><p><span>将马天尼杯冰杯，随之将意式浓缩咖啡，伏特加，百利甜，甜牛奶和依次加入已有冰块的摇杯中充分摇匀，最后滤入鸡尾酒杯，加入柠檬做装饰。一杯简单好喝的意式马天尼就做好啦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「本期单词表」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>peer pressure-</span></em><span>同僚压力</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>workshop-</span></em><span>研讨会</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>match-</span></em><span>匹配</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「时间轴」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">0:25</a> 特调简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">0:58</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">1:19</a> 投稿故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a> 为什么会有被社团拒之门外的烦恼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">6:36</a> 什么是群体？群体的“群体性”来自哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 群体认同带来的好处和烦恼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 群体的好处烦恼是否可以平衡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a> 一个人的力量能否改变一个群体？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 听众问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>——怎样分辨群体的“好”与“坏”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">37:16</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 歌曲推荐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「本期歌单」</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>开场音乐：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>NOS BALLADES</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>故事音乐：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>Luv Letter- DJ OKAWARI</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>Guns Of Brixton-Nouvelle Vague</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Gone with the Wind-Dirk Reichardt</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Weekend à Rome-Nouvelle Vague/Vanessa Paradis</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>L'horloge tourne-Mickael Miro</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>结尾音乐：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>New Soul-Yeal Naim</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvfSi2lGtUYW-Fy9a4TlVFaaap3I.m4a" length="56193623" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtdUhNVjhkWGxQSzNCNG1hc1BLbTA5elBXRjcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E03-有限的生命，无限的科技...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63516b5be67030aadb38fb29</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63516b5be67030aadb38fb29</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Oct 2022 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>现如今的社会里充斥着无处不在的新鲜科技，人们处于现代科研成果的接受能力也正在被逐步提升。在这样一个被科技快速运转的社会背景下，我们要如何基于伦理道德的去管控科研发展呢？来和我们一起聊聊关于科技发展的那些想法吧！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>服务生/调音师：暮暮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>调酒师：菲菲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>驻讲人：藜藜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>特邀客人：虫博士</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>后厨：蓝蓝</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>「特调配方」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>局·B-52 bomber</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>咖啡力娇酒 1/3</span></p><span></span><p><span>百利甜酒 1/3</span></p><span></span><p><span>伏特加 1/3</span></p><span></span><p><span>依次倒入咖啡力娇酒，百利甜和伏特加，随即可看到分明的层次。最后用打火机在酒杯口快速的转一圈，在酒杯中间点火</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「本期单词表」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>虫博士：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Horizon Worlds —</span></em><span>（一个元宇宙平台）</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Individual boundary </span></em><span>—个人边界</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Boundary —</span></em><span>边界</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>HIV —</span></em><span>艾滋病</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Historical data</span></em><span> —历史数据</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Prediction —</span></em><span>预测</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Object detection</span></em><span> —物体识别</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Detect</span></em><span> —识别</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Funding —</span></em><span>资金</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Think out of the box —</span></em><span>跳出思维定势想问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>藜藜：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Cultural norm —</span></em><span>文化规范</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>R&amp;D (research &amp; development)</span></em><span> —研发</span></p><span></span><p><span>菲菲：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Criteria</span></em><span> —准则</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「时间轴」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">0:22</a> 特调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">0:46</a> 虫博士歌声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">2:50</a> Horizon Worlds平台性骚扰事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">3:48</a> 美剧西部世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">6:56</a> 国家对于核武器的限制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">7:19</a> 南科大副教授基因编辑实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">9:18</a> AI在艺术领域的发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> AI代替人类的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> 研究经费应该从哪里来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 歌曲推荐</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>开场音乐：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>NOS BALLADES</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>Beginners-Peter Andersen</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Leaves in the Wind-Isaac Shepard</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Bloom-Tony Anderson/Bonnie Brooksbank</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Gone with the Wind-Dirk Reichardt</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Weekend à Rome-Nouvelle Vague/Vanessa Paradis</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>结尾音乐：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>New Divide-Linkin Park</span></em></p>]]></description>
