  <item>
    <title>E02-现在，谈一场恋爱吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633fe9732a992d56e91e56ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">633fe9732a992d56e91e56ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Oct 2022 08:55:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>你还相信爱情吗？当幼时向往的童话在长大后似乎变成破碎的气泡，当想象中的甜蜜在现实中似乎只剩眼泪和愤慨，爱情还值得我们去追求吗？</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>服务生/调音师：暮暮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>调酒师：藜藜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>驻讲人：菲菲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>后厨：蓝蓝</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>「特调配方」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>局·Mimosa</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>1/2 香槟</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>1/2橙汁</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>1片橙子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>1片柠檬</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>冰块</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>制作方法：将橙汁放入冰镇的调酒器中，加入冰块，搅拌一下。把与橙汁等份的香槟酒倒入冰镇的长形香槟杯中，微微搅拌，放入柠檬与鲜橙来做点缀，最后一搓橙皮来增加香气。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「时间轴」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;特调简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> &nbsp;嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;投稿故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> &nbsp;为什么大家都不相信爱情了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> &nbsp;爱情的本来面目</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>爱情有很多不同的形式，以不以结婚为目的的恋爱都可以是爱情，长期短期都可以是爱情。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>爱情中一定会有吵架，两个不同的个体就好比两个大小不一的齿轮一定是要经历碰撞和摩擦才可能契合到顺利运转</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>爱情的本质是两个个体之间的互相吸引，依赖，习惯，不同形式的爱情的本质是相似的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>爱情的“麻烦”并非是爱情独有的，任何人际关系都需要维持和养护，任何人际关系也都可能给你带来幸福和伤害。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> &nbsp;来自听众的爱情问题</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>恋爱中如何沟通？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>怎么避免沟通中出现伤害？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如何处理爱情当中的产生的现实问题？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>爱情中的双方一定要平等吗？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1924">32:04</a> &nbsp;爱情还值得相信吗or完美爱情会存在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> &nbsp;结束语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> &nbsp;歌曲推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>开场音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>NOS BALLADES</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>故事音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>Luv Letter- DJ OKAWARI</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>L'horloge tourne-Mickael Miro</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>Garota de Ipanema-Rose passos</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>Meu Négo-Thievery Corporation/Karina Zaviani</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>Guns Of Brixton-Nouvelle Vague</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>Weekend à Rome-Nouvelle Vague/Vanessa Paradis</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>一个人-王栎鑫</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>结尾音乐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>City of stars-Justin Hurwitz</span></em></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
