  <item>
    <title>E01-焦虑是可以被诉说的吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6331d1632a992d56e91e50c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6331d1632a992d56e91e50c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Sep 2022 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>焦虑应该被诉说吗？我们生活在一个全民焦虑的时代，却似乎很难找到应对焦虑的方式、排解焦虑的出口。今天，局外人陪你一起聊一聊焦虑的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：暮暮</span></p><span></span><p><span>主讲：藜藜</span></p><span></span><p><span>副讲：菲菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>后勤：蓝蓝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「特调配方」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>局·old fashion</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>45ml黑麦威士忌 （加拿大）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>1块方糖</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>1块桔皮</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2片青柠 （装饰）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>1粒冰球</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>安高天苦精 - 3 dash</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>清水</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>搅拌杯中加入橙皮，青柠和方糖，将苦精滴于方糖之上后加入15ml威士忌，以酒化糖（划重点 等下要考）方糖融化后搅拌均匀，加入冰球，清水和剩余威士忌继续搅拌后过滤到威士忌酒杯中</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「时间轴」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> 今日特调介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> ：嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> &nbsp;：我们的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a>：不同社会群体的压力不同点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a>：接纳自身的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a>：诉说焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> ：接纳他人的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> ：如何看待「优势者的苦难不值一提」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> ：平衡自己与他人的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a>：对身边人敞开心扉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a>：来自藜藜的表白（对暮暮！！！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> ：结束语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>：歌曲推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>开场音乐：</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>NOS BALLADES</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>故事音乐：</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Luv Letter- DJ OKAWARI</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>背景音乐：</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>L'horloge tourne-Mickael Miro</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Garota de Ipanema-Rose passos</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Meu Négo-Thievery Corporation/Karina Zaviani</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Guns Of Brixton-Nouvelle Vague</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Weekend à Rome-Nouvelle Vague/Vanessa Paradis</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>结尾音乐：</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>给你给我-毛不易</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
